# 5-to-32 decoder for the opcode: a Dec2 on A4 A3 picks a group of eight,
# a Dec3 on A2 A1 A0 picks the line in it. G0..G3 are the group lines
# (opcodes 0-7, 8-15, 16-23, 24-31).
chip Dec5
    in A0, A1, A2, A3, A4
    out Y0, Y1, Y2, Y3, Y4, Y5, Y6, Y7, Y8, Y9, Y10, Y11, Y12, Y13, Y14, Y15, Y16, Y17, Y18, Y19
    out Y20, Y21, Y22, Y23, Y24, Y25, Y26, Y27, Y28, Y29, Y30, Y31, G0, G1, G2, G3

    G0, G1, G2, G3 = Dec2(A3, A4, 1)
    Y0, Y1, Y2, Y3, Y4, Y5, Y6, Y7 = Dec3(A0, A1, A2, G0)
    Y8, Y9, Y10, Y11, Y12, Y13, Y14, Y15 = Dec3(A0, A1, A2, G1)
    Y16, Y17, Y18, Y19, Y20, Y21, Y22, Y23 = Dec3(A0, A1, A2, G2)
    Y24, Y25, Y26, Y27, Y28, Y29, Y30, Y31 = Dec3(A0, A1, A2, G3)
